Phase 6 – Project Testing

1. Project Title
FitBuddy – AI Fitness Plan Generator using Gemini Models

2. Testing Objective
The objective of this phase is to test the FitBuddy application and verify that it works correctly for different user inputs.

3. Testing Methods

3.1 Functional Testing
Check whether each feature works as expected:
User can enter fitness details.
User can select a fitness goal.
Generate Plan button works.
Gemini generates a response.
Generated fitness plan is displayed correctly.
Regenerate option works.

3.2 Input Testing
Test the application using different:
Ages
Heights and weights
Fitness goals
Activity levels
Fitness experience levels

3.3 User Interface Testing
Check whether:
All fields are clearly visible.
Buttons work correctly.
Text is readable.
The application works properly on different screen sizes.

3.4 Error Testing
Check how the application responds when:
Required fields are empty.
Invalid information is entered.
Internet connection is unavailable.
Gemini does not return a response.

